OL,4,CLorry driver banned after Prosecco     
OL,5,Cspilled in crash                       
OL,6,GA lorry driver whose dangerous driving 
OL,7,Gleft Prosecco spilled over the M4 and  
OL,8,Gpart of the motorway shut for about    
OL,9,Gseven-and-a-half hours has been banned 
OL,10,Gfrom driving for a year.               
OL,12,FPiotr Tkaczyk, 41, was driving a       
OL,13,FMercedes lorry in Berkshire when it    
OL,14,Fclipped another vehicle, scoring       
OL,15,Fthrough the side his lorry, sending    
OL,16,Fbottles crashing onto the road.        
OL,18,FAn empty shipping container was        
OL,19,Fknocked sideways and off the other     
OL,20,Florry on 27 April.                     
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
