OL,4,CPolice drones tackle rooftop urban     
OL,5,Cexploring trend                        
OL,6,GPolice are using drones, plain-clothes 
OL,7,Gofficers and targeted patrols to       
OL,8,Gtackle a rise in urban exploring.      
OL,10,FDorset Police said its drone team      
OL,11,Fprovided aerial surveillance for       
OL,12,Fofficers on the ground during a recent 
OL,13,Fday of action in Bournemouth town      
OL,14,Fcentre and would continue to be        
OL,15,Finvolved in the crackdown.             
OL,17,FOn the same day, three teenagers were  
OL,18,Fordered to leave the area and had      
OL,19,Ftheir phones seized after a group was  
OL,20,Freported on the roof of The Brass Haus 
OL,21,Fin Westover Road.                      
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
